  "body": "### What is the issue with the Notifications API Standard?\n\nPart of #208 and #5.\r\n\r\nJust found that Both Firefox and Chrome depends on [the legacy URL encoding behavior](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/urls-and-fetching.html#encoding-parsing-a-url), while [Safari has no icon support](https://searchfox.org/wubkat/rev/f8504f25d2ccc6a64957e53ab8c4e42885007fb0/Source/WebCore/Modules/notifications/NotificationResourcesLoader.cpp#52-56).\r\n\r\nWe can spec that as is, but maybe it's worth changing to use utf-8? For now I'll gather use counter for this.",
